{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fkJ-GMlfs-TIDTe2_P_zCg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:44.658674+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fkJ-GMlfs-TIDTe2_P_zCg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/brouxCiaE8ZicHTnq61pibO1hY7l1x5ndMNcnlk6zUYVR6yK7JHYzMplAtVhH2JUaYwiaGibnia5dvia2XxrRT4uUA4iaHwnsUIOuol76Ychan5Gib4s/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/brouxCiaE8Z8iaRDhXy3hnxUEyIxpoA2MgkRgmWibPaRqL5yatnVG2l4YN0OI61vqpfDnkDcoYUU7VdLv4KmqNO2sIojBbNAffHOr3kBaUibgyc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2027年，广东外语外贸大学广东国际战略研究院将继续接收应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读全球经济治理和欧洲学硕士学位研究生。根据上级文件精神与研究院实际情况，现将我院2027年接收应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生（以下简称“推免生”）预报名工作通知如下：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、研究院简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/brouxCiaE8ZicE2YSYSGWhrwric5G5wKiaibzSzF3fk9ycVFT83fF5s0AJ2N6UsG14HbbFA2C0wfTjTaGlAkzcO7l4e3hvENH1qENXTgFkV4fO5o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/brouxCiaE8Z8cnu0yYO1lmkjl44mMvthkcMibicWvXV1oicm0n19YrQF2p4ibE0aAVNj3lF0JsRkhHel2MsI8Ypecwa85JFZ6PtzwWG0b6KwTWMo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>两个专业具体拟招生人数以学校最终公布的2027年研究生招生专业目录为准，实际录取人数以最后确认录取人数为准。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、报名申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>推免生申请须同时具备以下条件：</span></p><p><span>（一）获得本科学校的推荐免试资格；</span></p><p><span>（二）思想政治素质高，有理想、有道德、守纪律；</span></p><p><span>（三）学术研究兴趣浓厚，专业基础扎实；</span></p><p><span>（四）通过CET四级考试。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、报名申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（一）推免生须于<span>9月4日15:00—9月17日12:00</span>登录广东外语外贸大学研招系统（网址：https://yanzhao.gdufs.edu.cn/kspt/）预报名；9月11日—17日广东战略研究院审核回复考生是否获得复试资格；复试时间由研究院具体通知。</span></p><p><span>推免生资格审核确认、报考、录取以及备案公开等相关工作，最终均须通过教育部“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）进行。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）确认参加复试的考生须在规定时间内参加复试，逾期不参加的将视为放弃。</span><strong><span>复试时须提交以下材料</span></strong><span>以供资格审查：</span></p><p><span>1. 本人身份证；</span></p><p><span>2. 学生证；</span></p><p><span>3. 研究生招生思想政治和品德表现审查表；</span></p><p><span>4. 本科学习期间的成绩单（大一到大三期间）；</span></p><p><span>5. 外语等级证书；</span></p><p><span>6. 获奖证书等材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（三）考生收到复试通知后，须自行在广东外语外贸大学研究生招生信息网（网址：http:yz.gdufs.edu.cn）下载体检表，自行前往二级甲等以上医院体检，并于复试时将体检表与其他报名材料一并提交研究院审核。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、推免生复试</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）推免生须按规定参加复试；</span></p><p><span>（二）复试采取现场复试或网络远程面试的方式，具体由研究院确定并通知；</span></p><p><span>（三）对跨一级学科申请的学生，相应考核标准由研究院制定。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、拟录取</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）所有获得推荐资格的应届生均须登录“推免服务系统”进行报名、缴费、录取及信息备案工作（未经我院公示或未在“推免服务系统”备案的考生不予录取）。未在规定时间内完成网上报名确认手续者视为自动放弃，不予录取。</span></p><p><span>（二）已被我院接收的推免生，不得再报名参加统考，否则将取消推免录取资格，列为统考生。</span></p><p><span>（三）推免生录取名单及新生学籍注册均以“推免服务系统”备案信息为准。</span></p><p><span>（四）如申请材料弄虚作假，一经发现将取消录取资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、推免生资格复审</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>对获得录取资格的推免生，由研究院在新生入学报到时进行资格复审。未通过资格复审者，将取消其入学资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>八、咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/brouxCiaE8Zic0yZicvvBWxCHIcIYNzLOkw0lOxca28SZROLmgU9kKRh2MiaP5Pd2c012FdNjpddm2iaJ4XYvzJiaQNUu3jZgatasgvg3XicjLnx5A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>对获得录取资格的推免生，由研究院在新生入学报到时进行资格复审。未通过资格复审者，将取消其入学资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>九、温馨提示</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）在复试前，若考生尚未知晓是否获得推免生资格，可先参加我院复试。</span></p><p><span>（二）参加复试后，若考生取得当年推免生资格，则复试成绩有效；若未取得推免生资格，则复试成绩无效。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>若上级部门对2027年招生政策有新调整或规定，以新政策为准。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>广东国际战略研究院</span></p><p><span>2026年9月7日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>编辑|李胜苗</span></p><p><span>审核|张嘉诺 刘贻泳</span></p><p><span>复审|林泽龙</span></p><p><span>终审|韩永辉</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><b><span>GIIS</span></b></p></section></section></section><section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>GIIS图书</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/brouxCiaE8Z8yBWBjXOYAhlYFAJnHTLibp49TGHY76cwMSYyepwaibC0QW8QSJWsPicHSgN57LyN0YyW8Y7T218OyN6cmEsxKfnDyhKOODWgIX4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/brouxCiaE8ZiciaO9lyMociaYibFtDK1BCaZXJ2OfxIzk4ms2DOd6jA7zriaDpn2UGZecibcjuxEiaFuWepJPyxLAHdV7buWjLKSQBOpicicXdUibnQu5Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/brouxCiaE8ZicgGTjaBZYC9OgehibRVHkRTO8j2Gib6aqgWLEknctVicRuC4RVkadbjfBkwibEUhy008A0TQUa0DnpUy352PWnxWLQEhntF3RtjDU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" s